            "detailed_description": "A Cold War super computer has gone rogue and is printing launch codes for a first strike.  There is only one way to prevent nuclear Armageddon; enter the dot matrix, collect the codes, and defeat the ASCII army.<br><br>ASCII Attack is a retro style indie action title inspired by arcade games of yesteryear.  It is a skill based game with a unique set of controls and a new take on classic arcade action.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Take the fight to the enemy and battle on 25 levels of 80s era dot matrix printer paper.<br></li><li>Multiple modes and enemies provide extended gameplay challenges.<br></li><li>Peace out and live through waves of invincible enemies in Survival mode.<br></li><li>Embrace the fight and unleash the power of the ASCII @om bomb.<br></li><li>Face the ultimate challenge in the ASCII Kicker mode.<br></li><li>Full Steam Controller and 360 Gamepad support; perfect for Big Picture.</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "A Cold War super computer has gone rogue and is printing launch codes for a first strike.  There is only one way to prevent nuclear Armageddon; enter the dot matrix, collect the codes, and defeat the ASCII army.<br><br>ASCII Attack is a retro style indie action title inspired by arcade games of yesteryear.  It is a skill based game with a unique set of controls and a new take on classic arcade action.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Take the fight to the enemy and battle on 25 levels of 80s era dot matrix printer paper.<br></li><li>Multiple modes and enemies provide extended gameplay challenges.<br></li><li>Peace out and live through waves of invincible enemies in Survival mode.<br></li><li>Embrace the fight and unleash the power of the ASCII @om bomb.<br></li><li>Face the ultimate challenge in the ASCII Kicker mode.<br></li><li>Full Steam Controller and 360 Gamepad support; perfect for Big Picture.</li></ul>",
